      "releaseNotes": "* Smoother Sign-In & Registration: Streamlined verification flow and a smarter login screen that remembers your preferred sign-in method.\n* Ticket Management Fixes: Resolved duplicate button taps on Reactivate, Pause, and Refund actions, plus clearer status labels on redeemed vouchers.\n* Refreshed Rewards & Referrals: Simplified points overview, cleaner sharing options for referral codes, and a streamlined Jobticket email request flow.\n* Offline & Profile Fixes: Fixed an issue where you were prompted to complete your profile after being offline.\n* Crash & Stability Improvements: Squashed several crashes related to device locales, web views, and authentication for a smoother, more reliable experience.",
